250 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Artificial intelligence has increasingly become embedded in our technology and day to day lives\056 As an individual who regularly posts content to the internet\054 I believe it is important for me to disclose where I stand on AI\054 and how I use the technology when posting content\056 \n\nI also want to make it clear that I am not inherently against all forms of AI\056 However\054 I also believe that there is a time and place for AI\054 and it should be used in an ethical\054 sustainable\054 and responsible manner\056 Some great examples of how AI has positively impacted society include medical fields\054 where AI is being used to detect early symptoms\054 which has the potential to save many lives\056 On the other hand\054 we must remain aware of the harms that AI can have on society\056 This includes water usage\054 taking jobs\054 and spreading misinformation\056\n\050I also want to make clear that the term \030AI\031 is broad\054 and its literal definition encompasses an enormous subset of computing technology\056 For the purposes of this document\054 I am specifically addressing Generative AI \050GenAI\051\054 which is a subset of AI as a whole\056 This form of AI is quite controversial right now\054 and is also the form of AI most relevant to the content that I post on this platform\056\n\nInstagram Posts\056 Under most circumstances\054 I do not and will not use GenAI intentionally for regular content that I post to Instagram\056 This includes Instagram Posts\054 Stories\054 and Reels\056 My own content which does not use intentional GenAI include\072 photography posts\054 written commentary\054 and weather updates\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 251 0 R
     /Pg 246 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

